                <div class="rendering rendering_researchoutput  rendering_researchoutput_harvard rendering_contributiontojournal rendering_harvard rendering_contributiontojournal_harvard">Cunliffe, J, Martin, J, Décary-Hétu, D<a rel="Person" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/persons/judith.aldridge/" class="link"><span> &amp; Aldridge, J</span></a> 2017, '<a rel="ContributionToJournal" href="https://research.manchester.ac.uk/en/publications/an-island-apart-risks-and-prices-in-the-australian-cryptomarket-d/" class="link harvard_title"><span>An Island Apart? Risks and Prices in the Australian Cryptomarket Drug Trade</span></a>', <span><em>International Journal of Drug Policy</em></span>, vol. 50, pp. 64-73. <a onclick="window.open(this.href, '_blank','noopener,noreferrer'); return false;" href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.drugpo.2017.09.005" class="link"><span>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.drugpo.2017.09.005</span></a></div>
